WEBVTT

00:11.010 --> 00:13.930
KIRINOSHIMA MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:14.014 --> 00:15.557
Our club's so demanding.

00:15.640 --> 00:17.892
I was counting the days
till it was finally over.

00:17.976 --> 00:20.979
You know who's cringe?
Miki. She didn't fit in at all.

00:21.062 --> 00:22.814
- She took it way too seriously.
- I know.

00:22.897 --> 00:25.483
But I was too scared to speak up.

00:25.567 --> 00:27.193
Me too.

00:28.445 --> 00:32.282
I wanted a new environment
where I could change myself.

00:33.033 --> 00:34.409
TOP GRADES GUARANTEED
CRAM SCHOOL

00:34.492 --> 00:37.412
I chose a cram school outside of my city

00:37.495 --> 00:39.873
to get into
an academically competitive high school.

00:43.126 --> 00:44.127
MIKI

00:44.210 --> 00:45.962
I knew this would happen, but...

00:46.046 --> 00:48.423
I don't know anyone here.

00:48.506 --> 00:51.468
Everyone's already formed
their friend groups.

00:51.551 --> 00:53.762
I've got to approach... No, I can't.

00:53.845 --> 00:55.847
FRIEND GROUPS - GIRLS
TERRIFYING COMBINATION

00:55.930 --> 00:58.725
They may act sweet and friendly
on the surface,

00:58.808 --> 01:03.229
but they'll talk bad about me
behind my back.

01:03.813 --> 01:04.814
GROAN

01:04.898 --> 01:08.610
I'm tearing up just thinking about it.
It's turned into trauma.

01:16.242 --> 01:17.619
I'm so lonely.

01:19.829 --> 01:22.874
Hey, you here alone? Care if I sit by you?

01:28.338 --> 01:29.923
- Who are you?
- Me?

01:30.507 --> 01:32.425
My name's Minato Amamiya.

02:58.344 --> 03:03.975
THE RAMPARTS OF ICE

03:04.642 --> 03:08.980
EPISODE 3
3+(←)1

03:09.063 --> 03:11.983
MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

03:12.066 --> 03:15.194
Hear me out.
Why does the upcoming exam cover so much?

03:15.278 --> 03:17.822
Why didn't you start studying earlier?

03:17.906 --> 03:20.867
This is off topic, but why are you back?

03:20.950 --> 03:24.245
I forgot to grab my notebook.
I wanna study it today.

03:25.830 --> 03:27.290
- The torture never ends!
- Sheesh.

03:27.790 --> 03:29.459
A four-man study session.

03:30.793 --> 03:34.255
It feels a little strange.

03:35.214 --> 03:38.760
Listen, Miki. We broke up.

03:38.843 --> 03:40.845
What? Again? When?

03:40.929 --> 03:42.222
Two days ago.

03:42.305 --> 03:45.141
What? That's super recent!
What happened? What'd you do?

03:45.225 --> 03:47.435
Why do you assume it's my fault?

03:47.518 --> 03:48.811
Well, you know...

03:48.895 --> 03:49.896
LIVELY CHATTER

03:49.979 --> 03:52.732
Should I be listening?

03:52.815 --> 03:55.652
- She called me because she wanted to meet.
- What a personal thing to talk about...

03:55.735 --> 03:59.155
Man, I'm always getting dumped.

03:59.239 --> 04:00.657
That's what bothers you?

04:02.242 --> 04:04.369
What? Didn't expect it?

04:04.452 --> 04:05.703
Huh? No...

04:06.246 --> 04:08.039
How do I put it?

04:11.167 --> 04:14.545
Well, it's like...

04:16.714 --> 04:19.300
when you just go through a break up,

04:19.384 --> 04:22.762
I thought you're supposed
to be depressed or resentful.

04:24.555 --> 04:25.556
Not at all.

04:27.100 --> 04:32.313
On the contrary, I'm thankful
they liked me, even for a short time.

04:32.397 --> 04:33.648
Capisce?

04:34.148 --> 04:35.149
You hear this guy?

04:35.233 --> 04:36.317
Gee.

04:38.403 --> 04:41.197
Guess that's how some people see it.

04:42.907 --> 04:44.951
- You think I'm a player, huh?
- He got me.

04:45.952 --> 04:49.539
I may not look it, but I'm heartbroken.

04:50.540 --> 04:54.377
Of course he is.
That was insensitive of me.

04:54.877 --> 04:55.962
FEELING DOWN

04:56.045 --> 04:58.047
Sorry, I guess.

05:00.133 --> 05:03.553
Then, why don't you comfort me?

05:09.350 --> 05:11.686
Okay, that's enough from you!

05:11.769 --> 05:14.230
Minato, you're kinda like this.

05:14.314 --> 05:15.940
Your grip!

05:16.024 --> 05:20.778
Koyun, you can brush off
whatever Minato says.

05:20.862 --> 05:22.196
- 'Kay.
- How come?

05:26.034 --> 05:27.285
Miki?

05:27.869 --> 05:30.246
Yota-sensei, so, about this part...

05:33.333 --> 05:35.585
- Oops, there I go again.
- Ugh, again.

05:35.668 --> 05:37.545
Yota, you klutz!

05:37.628 --> 05:38.796
Klutz?

05:38.880 --> 05:42.216
What am I gonna do with you?
Always dropping things.

05:42.300 --> 05:43.426
Oh, shoot.

05:45.511 --> 05:48.097
FLUSTER FLUSTER
UGH!

05:48.681 --> 05:50.349
Here. Is that everything?

05:50.433 --> 05:51.559
Thanks.

05:57.023 --> 05:59.734
She laughs just like the rest of us.

06:02.653 --> 06:03.654
Oh, well.

06:05.740 --> 06:08.451
See ya. We're heading this way.

06:08.534 --> 06:09.827
Don't want us to walk with you?

06:09.911 --> 06:12.288
No thanks, but I appreciate the offer.

06:12.371 --> 06:16.042
I'm with her.
It's time for my grip strength to shine!

06:16.125 --> 06:17.877
Hey, it's actually really powerful.

06:17.960 --> 06:19.879
You be careful too, Miki.

06:21.964 --> 06:25.009
Bye, guys! Thanks again, Yota!

06:25.093 --> 06:27.470
What about me? I helped you with English.

06:27.553 --> 06:28.554
Thanks to you too.

06:28.638 --> 06:29.639
Am I an afterthought?

06:29.722 --> 06:32.975
Koyun! I want Dyna Potato by the station.
Can we stop by real quick?

06:33.059 --> 06:34.060
DYNAMITE POTATO

06:34.143 --> 06:36.062
I'm down, but what about dinner at home?

06:36.145 --> 06:38.815
Don't worry! It'll be an appetizer.

06:39.315 --> 06:40.399
Liar.

06:40.483 --> 06:42.652
I've got a separate stomach for it.

06:42.735 --> 06:44.862
Miki sure loves to chat.

06:44.946 --> 06:46.656
She should be like that all the time.

06:47.990 --> 06:49.575
What're you up to today, Yota?

06:50.868 --> 06:52.787
Wiener dog!

06:53.371 --> 06:55.206
I'll chomp on this
and head to the community center.

06:55.289 --> 06:58.543
You're kidding.
It's gonna catch up with you someday.

06:59.335 --> 07:01.129
Wanna have dinner at my place?

07:01.212 --> 07:03.131
My mom's always happy to see you.

07:04.215 --> 07:06.092
I'll pass. Thanks though.

07:06.175 --> 07:07.176
See ya.

07:09.762 --> 07:11.097
Don't overdo it.

07:11.681 --> 07:12.807
I know.

07:14.767 --> 07:16.310
With everything. I mean it.

07:21.732 --> 07:24.110
Yota acts that way,

07:24.735 --> 07:25.903
but as for her...

07:27.155 --> 07:28.865
What's on her mind?

07:31.284 --> 07:35.121
What if she has a crush on him?

07:39.584 --> 07:42.086
I wouldn't go for Yota if I were you.

07:48.384 --> 07:49.385
Wait for me!

07:49.469 --> 07:52.972
Koyun, how long have you known Minato?

07:54.348 --> 07:56.767
Huh? We only recently met.

07:56.851 --> 07:59.729
It was a little before
we walked home together.

08:01.105 --> 08:03.649
He approached me
at the bottom of the staircase, and...

08:03.733 --> 08:04.734
What'd he say to you?

08:08.613 --> 08:09.614
Huh?

08:13.784 --> 08:15.661
What did he say?

08:17.079 --> 08:20.208
Well, we really didn't talk about
anything important.

08:21.542 --> 08:22.793
Sorry.

08:22.877 --> 08:25.588
Koyun, you're kinda like this.

08:28.549 --> 08:31.761
Well, then it's fine, I guess.

08:33.638 --> 08:35.014
Miki...

08:45.024 --> 08:46.484
Could it be that she...

08:54.408 --> 08:56.369
I overslept.

08:58.246 --> 09:02.166
I wanted to start walking
when no one's on their way to school.

09:03.960 --> 09:06.671
That's at least half an hour earlier.

09:09.715 --> 09:11.968
Early morning during the exam period,

09:12.051 --> 09:15.513
that's when the path to school
becomes quiet for a change.

09:15.596 --> 09:16.806
This kind of vibe...

09:25.898 --> 09:27.858
For some reason, I like it.

09:31.112 --> 09:33.322
Hikawa, do you usually
walk to school around this time?

09:33.406 --> 09:35.241
- Huh?
- Morning.

09:35.825 --> 09:39.078
Here I was, thinking I left a tad early.

09:39.579 --> 09:40.746
That's admirable.

09:40.830 --> 09:41.831
No...

09:44.208 --> 09:47.003
I come much later
when it's not exam period.

09:47.086 --> 09:50.590
And I planned
on leaving much earlier this morning.

09:50.673 --> 09:52.592
Ugh, it'll take too long to explain.

09:53.843 --> 09:56.220
Not at all.

10:04.854 --> 10:06.397
Common interests...

10:09.567 --> 10:10.776
Say, Hikawa,

10:11.527 --> 10:13.613
do you know a guy named Igarashi?

10:15.364 --> 10:17.617
Wait. What?

10:17.700 --> 10:20.369
What did he say just now?

10:22.079 --> 10:23.205
Igarashi?

10:24.665 --> 10:26.667
Why'd you ask? Do you know him?

10:26.751 --> 10:30.880
My soccer club has joint practice
with West High from time to time.

10:30.963 --> 10:32.632
That's where I met him.

10:33.341 --> 10:37.219
Were you friends with him? He might
recognize you if I told him your name.

10:37.303 --> 10:40.139
No. We had no connection whatsoever.

10:41.140 --> 10:43.017
He wouldn't recognize me
even if you told him my name.

10:43.976 --> 10:45.102
I see.

10:45.186 --> 10:48.814
Well, he's coming to our school, but
you wouldn't recognize each other then.

10:48.898 --> 10:49.940
When is that?

10:50.024 --> 10:52.902
It'll be during club activities
on the afternoon of the last day of exams.

10:52.985 --> 10:53.986
Really.

10:54.570 --> 10:56.572
I'm definitely leaving early.

10:59.700 --> 11:03.454
Wait, if he's asking me about him, then...

11:03.954 --> 11:06.832
Is Amamiya good friends with Igarashi?

11:06.916 --> 11:09.126
Joint practice starts
right as the exams end.

11:09.210 --> 11:12.088
- We're pullin' out all the stops.
- They even mentioned their middle schools.

11:12.672 --> 11:14.590
West High's exams are also...

11:15.508 --> 11:19.011
Oh, no. I can't pay attention
to what he's saying at all.

11:33.484 --> 11:37.363
I brought questions
for last year's finals today.

11:37.863 --> 11:40.282
Apparently, the test for subjects
like History barely changes.

11:40.783 --> 11:43.035
What? How'd you get your hands on it?

11:43.119 --> 11:45.871
Let's just say I asked
for a tiny favor from a senior.

11:47.248 --> 11:49.208
You're coming to my classroom
after school again, right?

11:52.461 --> 11:54.338
Well, later then.

11:54.839 --> 11:55.881
BOW

12:00.803 --> 12:03.139
Morning. It's been like, what, yesterday?

12:04.473 --> 12:06.058
What do I even say?

12:07.518 --> 12:10.563
He's not a shy one. He can talk to anyone.

12:10.646 --> 12:11.897
STRONG COMMUNICATOR

12:16.193 --> 12:18.529
Miki has a crush on...

12:19.572 --> 12:22.366
No, it's only a guess at this point.

12:23.617 --> 12:27.955
Miki looked clearly bothered
that me and Amamiya knew each other.

12:30.124 --> 12:32.501
His connection with Igarashi
is worrisome too.

12:33.169 --> 12:36.380
This might be a good time
for me to take a step back from it all.

12:41.510 --> 12:42.970
SIGH

12:43.053 --> 12:45.514
All I want is some peace.

12:51.645 --> 12:53.481
Koyun and Minato...

12:58.444 --> 12:59.445
This guy's Yota.

12:59.528 --> 13:00.654
He's massive.

13:01.822 --> 13:04.200
My younger brother's a tough one like me.

13:04.742 --> 13:06.911
Yup. My cram school just ended.

13:06.994 --> 13:08.913
Yup, I'm at the usual convenience store.

13:08.996 --> 13:10.414
What're you worried about?

13:10.498 --> 13:12.500
Wonder what sides everyone brought today.

13:12.583 --> 13:13.876
Yeah, lookin' forward to lunch!

13:14.376 --> 13:16.378
Hey Miki. Let's swap our sides.

13:16.462 --> 13:17.880
Let's!

13:20.508 --> 13:21.926
Hikawa.

13:22.009 --> 13:24.720
It's good that
you're a serious student and all,

13:24.803 --> 13:27.056
but you should at least
have some fun during lunch.

13:27.681 --> 13:29.683
But the teacher's room is warm.

13:29.767 --> 13:31.560
What are you? A cat?

13:32.144 --> 13:33.979
Anyway, got a question for me?

13:34.063 --> 13:37.733
You do it like this, and it becomes this.
That's how you get the answer.

13:37.816 --> 13:39.568
That makes sense.

13:40.152 --> 13:42.446
Now, be on your way. Go.

13:42.530 --> 13:43.739
- Shoo.
- Tsk.

13:43.822 --> 13:45.574
I'll go visit Noriko then.

13:45.658 --> 13:47.701
Stop going room to room for the heater.

13:49.453 --> 13:51.247
She stops by here often.

13:51.330 --> 13:52.706
Yes, she does.

13:53.582 --> 13:57.419
I've never seen her
hang out with the other students.

13:57.503 --> 13:58.712
I'm concerned for her.

14:00.798 --> 14:03.968
Perhaps she finds it easier
to speak to adults.

14:04.635 --> 14:09.723
There's a clear distance
between a teacher and a student.

14:10.391 --> 14:12.977
She knows there's a line you won't cross,

14:13.060 --> 14:15.896
and that's why she feels at ease with you.

14:16.564 --> 14:19.984
I want the students to be besties
and enjoy their youth together!

14:20.067 --> 14:21.360
THE TEEN YEARS GO BY IN A FLASH!

14:21.443 --> 14:24.446
Suwa-sensei, you should know
that forcing your good intentions

14:24.530 --> 14:27.116
can end up hurting people.

14:27.199 --> 14:30.494
Matsumoto, what happened to you?

14:31.495 --> 14:36.458
Let's see. My paint set and sketchbook...

14:37.084 --> 14:40.504
- Is that everything for today's class?
- I'm saying it for your own good.

14:40.588 --> 14:43.591
- No, seriously.
- You gotta know your limits.

14:43.674 --> 14:44.758
POKE OUT

14:44.842 --> 14:46.135
Can I take your word for it?

14:46.218 --> 14:47.511
It's Amamiya.

14:47.595 --> 14:48.679
FLASHBACK

14:48.762 --> 14:50.598
- Why did you ignore me?
- I'm reminded.

14:50.681 --> 14:51.682
I need some distance.

14:52.349 --> 14:56.312
No, wait.
He's surrounded by people I don't know.

14:56.395 --> 14:58.689
Besides, he hasn't noticed me.

14:58.772 --> 15:00.524
Remember, I need some distance!

15:01.859 --> 15:04.028
This is fine. I'm not ignoring him.

15:05.112 --> 15:09.408
I'll stay quiet
so he walks off without noticing.

15:10.159 --> 15:12.912
No, he's looking right at me.

15:12.995 --> 15:14.830
BOW
THE QUICK BOW AND DIP OUT STRATEGY

15:14.914 --> 15:15.915
Hi.

15:17.499 --> 15:18.500
YAY

15:18.584 --> 15:20.044
Man, he's so expressive
with his movements.

15:20.127 --> 15:21.128
HELLO THERE

15:21.211 --> 15:23.088
- What is it?
- Stare.

15:23.172 --> 15:24.173
STARE

15:24.256 --> 15:25.633
Stop it! Make it stop!

15:25.716 --> 15:27.927
Please, don't mind me!

15:28.510 --> 15:29.637
Gimme a sec.

15:30.638 --> 15:32.514
Wait. He's coming over!

15:32.598 --> 15:34.683
There really isn't a need to do this.

15:38.020 --> 15:39.188
What're you doing?

15:40.272 --> 15:42.858
You should've just said hi.

15:42.942 --> 15:44.234
There's no need to peek out.

15:44.735 --> 15:45.903
But...

15:45.986 --> 15:47.571
Before I forget.

15:48.155 --> 15:49.949
Tell me your contact info.

15:50.449 --> 15:51.450
Distance!

15:58.958 --> 15:59.959
Thanks.

16:03.045 --> 16:04.463
What's in that bag?

16:05.381 --> 16:09.134
I'm headed to Art next, so...

16:09.218 --> 16:10.761
I see.

16:10.844 --> 16:13.013
Class 2's elective is Art.

16:13.097 --> 16:15.182
What're you doing? Oil paint?

16:16.392 --> 16:19.687
No, we're doing acrylic gouache right now.

16:19.770 --> 16:21.230
Good luck!

16:25.192 --> 16:26.443
Miki.

16:28.445 --> 16:30.114
- Oops.
- What is it?

16:30.197 --> 16:32.866
Sorry. Switching classrooms. Gotta go.

16:32.950 --> 16:33.951
Time to get going!

16:34.034 --> 16:35.035
WHOOSH

16:37.371 --> 16:39.039
She was by herself again.

16:41.208 --> 16:42.209
SMILE
WITH YOTA

16:42.292 --> 16:43.293
Hey, Yota.

16:43.377 --> 16:44.378
PHEW - TEEHEE - SMILE

16:44.461 --> 16:45.462
WITH MINATO

16:45.546 --> 16:46.922
I meant to stop by my locker.

16:47.006 --> 16:48.632
Switching classrooms.

16:49.717 --> 16:54.304
She acts way too differently between
the people she likes and everyone else.

16:54.972 --> 16:57.641
EVERYONE ELSE

17:00.894 --> 17:02.021
Heya.

17:02.104 --> 17:04.732
You approached the Queen
like it's nothing.

17:04.815 --> 17:06.567
You've got a heart of steel.

17:06.650 --> 17:09.903
Well, I was hoping we could be friends.

17:09.987 --> 17:11.655
But she ran away from me.

17:13.115 --> 17:14.324
Now I'm sad.

17:14.408 --> 17:17.411
As if you know what it's like to be sad.

17:17.494 --> 17:19.830
- For real.
- Come on, that's rude.

17:28.714 --> 17:30.674
Here they are. Last years' questions!

17:31.258 --> 17:33.677
Minato, you're godly!

17:33.761 --> 17:36.722
This will be my ticket
to ace the subjects heavy on memorization.

17:36.805 --> 17:38.849
You're not in the position to relax yet.

17:38.932 --> 17:39.933
Keep your guard up.

17:40.017 --> 17:44.313
The last math test
had a super low average score,

17:44.396 --> 17:46.398
so there's a chance it'll be fairly easy.

17:46.482 --> 17:48.442
I hope that's the case.

17:48.525 --> 17:51.779
And what was your score
on this test with a low average, Yota?

17:52.946 --> 17:54.448
Say something!

17:54.531 --> 17:58.285
Yota, you could've enrolled at East High.

17:58.368 --> 18:00.329
They've got a decent basketball team too.

18:00.412 --> 18:01.663
Why'd you pick Meiten?

18:01.747 --> 18:04.458
Huh? Because I live close by.

18:04.541 --> 18:07.211
That's why you chose this school?
And you're happy with that?

18:07.294 --> 18:08.295
Come on,

18:08.378 --> 18:12.091
he can't tell you that he deliberately
chose a school below his academic level

18:12.174 --> 18:15.928
so he can rank near the top and aim
for a designated-school recommendation.

18:16.011 --> 18:17.554
That's how it is.

18:17.638 --> 18:20.516
Hey. Minato, it's really not like that.

18:20.599 --> 18:22.559
Guess we're worlds apart.

18:22.643 --> 18:23.977
Miki!

18:27.314 --> 18:29.691
Koyun, you're locked in today.

18:30.359 --> 18:31.777
Hey! You changed the subject.

18:32.361 --> 18:35.823
Well, I wanted to get
some distractions off my mind.

18:36.698 --> 18:39.076
What? Is something distracting you?

18:39.159 --> 18:40.911
Yup. All sorts of things, actually.

18:45.207 --> 18:47.668
Like I thought.
She acts totally different.

18:48.585 --> 18:52.256
Hikawa, do you have a boyfriend?

18:54.550 --> 18:55.592
What?

18:56.677 --> 18:58.846
No, but...

19:00.222 --> 19:02.015
Why's he asking all of a sudden?

19:02.933 --> 19:04.059
Okay, then.

19:05.435 --> 19:06.728
What is it?

19:06.812 --> 19:09.273
What's the point of asking
something like that?

19:09.857 --> 19:11.775
Do you know a guy named Igarashi?

19:14.319 --> 19:18.031
Is Igarashi trying
to dig around through him?

19:18.615 --> 19:21.201
No, I'm definitely overthinking it.

19:21.285 --> 19:23.078
As if he'd get someone else to ask.

19:23.579 --> 19:26.623
It was a long time ago.
He wouldn't take it this far.

19:27.207 --> 19:28.250
Minato.

19:29.418 --> 19:31.420
You can't aim for her, all right?

19:36.175 --> 19:38.051
Is that what this is about?

19:38.635 --> 19:40.429
Can't I have her, Father?

19:40.512 --> 19:42.014
You won't date my daughter.

19:42.097 --> 19:43.724
They're joking around.

19:45.851 --> 19:47.686
See, I was just overthinking.

19:48.270 --> 19:51.440
Self-conscious and paranoid...

19:51.523 --> 19:52.941
I'm ashamed.

19:54.026 --> 19:55.569
Wait. What about Miki?

19:56.361 --> 19:57.863
Blank!

19:58.530 --> 20:00.490
I can't get a good read
on what she's thinking.

20:00.574 --> 20:02.367
What do I do?

20:02.451 --> 20:05.329
I can't even tell what
my childhood friend's feeling.

20:07.164 --> 20:10.417
I'm gonna replenish on sugar.

20:10.918 --> 20:12.002
SUGAR

20:13.170 --> 20:15.214
I'm gonna check out the vending machine.

20:15.297 --> 20:17.341
I'll grab something
for Koyun and Yota too.

20:17.424 --> 20:18.425
What about me?

20:18.508 --> 20:21.094
- You get your own.
- Hey!

20:22.179 --> 20:24.431
So, come with me.

20:30.187 --> 20:32.356
Huh? Sure.

20:36.944 --> 20:38.195
We'll be back soon.

20:45.244 --> 20:46.411
Miki...

20:47.996 --> 20:50.958
Hey, Miki. What was that about?

20:55.963 --> 20:58.382
I read the manga
you told me about, Ishida.

20:58.465 --> 21:01.260
See you later, Yoshino!

21:01.343 --> 21:05.389
Yamashita! About that anime you mentioned.

21:05.472 --> 21:08.141
- I watched it. It was good.
- You know,

21:08.225 --> 21:10.435
Minato's such a social butterfly.

21:10.519 --> 21:12.271
He's like that at school too.

21:12.354 --> 21:13.355
Really.

21:14.898 --> 21:17.985
I'm jealous. I wish I could be like him.

21:18.068 --> 21:19.861
Apparently, Minato

21:19.945 --> 21:23.573
can't help but intervene
when someone seems lonely.

21:24.533 --> 21:27.494
- What?
- It's like he pities them.

21:29.538 --> 21:31.456
Pities them?

21:37.963 --> 21:40.465
Here, I'll pay.

21:40.549 --> 21:42.467
I meant to buy Hikawa a drink anyway.

21:46.513 --> 21:47.681
Why?

21:48.265 --> 21:52.185
The other day, I tried
to talk to her here but it made her jump.

21:52.269 --> 21:55.439
She ended up buying
a super weird drink on accident.

21:55.522 --> 21:56.523
AUTHENTIC CURRY DRINK

21:56.606 --> 21:57.941
That's the one.

21:58.025 --> 21:59.860
I'd forgotten all about it until now.

22:06.325 --> 22:07.951
Say, Minato...

22:12.289 --> 22:14.458
What do you think of Koyun?

22:22.090 --> 22:23.091
What?

23:50.303 --> 23:55.308
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
